{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:meri:retrieval:research-portfolio-workflow:0.2.0",
  "title": "Meri Research Portfolio workflow reads 0.2.0 (MO-05)",
  "description": "Conversation-scoped Research Portfolio workflow reads served by Core `/api/clio/tools/<operation>` inside its trusted current-turn envelope. Shapes mirror the Core DTOs (`@capiro/shared` research-portfolios); Core owns the portfolio grant, client walls and revision facts. Validation grants no authority.",
